  <activity-date iso-date="2021-08-01" type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Climate resilient, equitable and inclusive water supply and sanitation facilities constructed.2. Healthy hygiene and sanitation behaviors promoted in target communities, schools and healthcare centres.3. Strengthened institutional capacity to plan, manage and sustain climate resilient, equitable WASH services.4. Community members, especially women, empowered and engaged to ensure their rights to climate resilient, equitable WASH services</narrative>
  </activity-date>
